Package: mtpR
Type: Package
Title: Microtiter Plate Layout and Data Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Emily", email = "ejpmohr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small toolkit for designing and reading microtiter plate
    layouts. It converts between well labels and numeric indices, assigns
    reactions and replicates to well positions across one or more plates
    with configurable spacing, draws 'ggplot2' plate maps, and reshapes
    plate-shaped data into tidy long format. An experimental 'shiny' app
    provides a graphical front-end.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    dplyr,
    DT,
    ggplot2,
    rlang,
    shiny,
    stringr,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/ejpmohr/mtpR
